px;">~</sup>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It's simple:</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 25px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Register</a>&nbsp;your business’ ABN and book an eligible flight between&nbsp;<b>12 - 19 June 2018</b>&nbsp;for travel until 31 August 2018<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">^</sup>.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Book via&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;or your preferred travel agent.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Remember to add the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number and business' ABN to each booking.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Once your business is registered, everyone who travels on an eligible Qantas flight and enters their ABN and Qantas Frequent Flyer number, will earn 50% more Status Credits. This means more Status Credits for every traveller!</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Ciutadella-Regular, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="Refer a business" title="Sign up and register" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-family: Ciutadella-Regular, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY" target="_blank" alt="Register now" title="Register now" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register now